    action: "Hold a 20-minute conversation this month in which each of you names what helps and what kills your desire without negotiating frequency; agree on a warm way to decline ('not tonight, but Saturday'), and if low desire is distressing, ask about a mindfulness-based or sex-therapy program rather than waiting it out.",
